---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Nasap Shop — la boutique Nasap3D, bientôt en ligne"
  description="Nasap Shop : la future boutique de Nasap3D, avec des objets imprimés en 3D à Nantes, prêts à offrir ou à poser chez soi. Ouverture prochainement."
  path="/shop"
  canonicalUrl="https://shop.nasap3d.com/"
  hideHeader
  hideFooter
>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@700&display=swap" />
  <header class="shop-head">
    <div class="shop-head-in">
      <a href="/shop" class="shop-brand" aria-label="Nasap Shop, accueil">
        <img src="/assets/nasap-shop-symbole.svg" width="60" height="36" alt="" />
        <span class="shop-brand-name"><span>Nasap</span> <span class="o">Shop</span></span>
      </a>
      <span class="shop-head-tag">par Nasap3D · Nantes</span>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="shop-soon">
    <div class="shop-card">
      <img class="shop-logo" src="/assets/nasap-shop-symbole.svg" width="120" height="72" alt="Logo Nasap Shop" />
      <p class="shop-kicker">Ouverture prochainement</p>
      <h1 class="shop-title">Nasap <span>Shop</span></h1>
      <p class="shop-lead">La boutique de l'atelier Nasap3D, à Nantes : des objets imprimés en 3D, pensés par nous et fabriqués dans notre atelier, prêts à offrir ou à poser chez soi.</p>
      <ul class="shop-points">
        <li>Fabriqués à Nantes, pièce par pièce</li>
        <li>Livraison partout en France</li>
        <li>Collections qui arrivent bientôt</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="shop-note">En attendant, l'atelier continue de fabriquer vos pièces sur mesure.</p>
      <div class="shop-actions">
        <a class="shop-btn shop-btn-primary" href="https://nasap3d.com/devis-instantane">Demander un devis</a>
        <a class="shop-btn" href="https://nasap3d.com/contact">Être prévenu de l'ouverture</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <footer class="shop-foot">
    <p>Nasap Shop est une boutique de l'atelier <a href="https://nasap3d.com/">Nasap3D</a>, Nantes · <a href="https://nasap3d.com/mentions-legales">Mentions légales</a></p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .shop-head { background: #faf6f0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28, 26, 24, 0.08); }
  .shop-head-in { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 78px; padding: 0 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; }
  .shop-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; }
  .shop-brand img { display: block; }
  .shop-brand-name { font-family: "Barlow Condensed", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap; color: #1c1a18; }
  .shop-brand-name .o { color: #ff5a3c; }
  .shop-head-tag { font-size: 13px; color: #6f665d; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .shop-head-tag { display: none; } }
  .shop-foot { background: #f3ece2; color: #6f665d; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; padding: 18px 16px; }
  .shop-foot p { margin: 0; }
  .shop-foot a { color: #c2391f; }
  .shop-soon { min-height: calc(100vh - 78px - 58px); align-items: center; }
  .shop-soon {
    background: #faf6f0;
    color: #3d3833;
    padding: 56px 16px 72px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .shop-card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
    background: #f3ece2;
    border: 1px solid rgba(28, 26, 24, 0.12);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 40px 28px;
    text-align: center;
    animation: shop-in 0.5s ease both;
  }
  @keyframes shop-in {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .shop-card { animation: none; }
  }
  .shop-logo { width: 120px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto 18px; display: block; }
  .shop-kicker {
    font-family: "Barlow Condensed", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c2391f;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  .shop-title {
    font-family: "Barlow Condensed", "Arial Narrow", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 12vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1;
    color: #1c1a18;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .shop-title span { color: #ff5a3c; }
  .shop-lead { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .shop-points {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #6f665d;
  }
  .shop-note { font-size: 14px; color: #6f665d; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .shop-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }
  .shop-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #1c1a18;
    color: #1c1a18;
    background: transparent;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .shop-btn-primary { background: #ff5a3c; border-color: #ff5a3c; }
  .shop-btn:hover { filter: brightness(0.96); }
  .shop-btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #1c1a18; outline-offset: 2px; }
</style>
